ss</a></li><li><a href="#a-closer-look-at-deep-swe" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">A closer look at DeepSWE</a></li><li><a href="#evaluation-methodology" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">Evaluation methodology</a></li><li><a href="#seeing-the-model-work" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">Seeing the model work</a></li><li><a href="#thinking-effort" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">Thinking effort</a></li><li><a href="#limitations" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">Limitations</a></li><li><a href="#what-actually-changed-in-this-model" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">What actually changed in this model</a></li><li class="pl-4 text-detail"><a href="#a-strong-base-then-new-post-training" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">A strong base, then new post-training</a></li><li class="pl-4 text-detail"><a href="#distribution-of-post-training-tasks" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">Distribution of post-training tasks</a></li><li class="pl-4 text-detail"><a href="#what-changed-in-the-training-loop" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">What changed in the training loop</a></li><li><a href="#the-bets-were-making" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">The bets we're making</a></li><li><a href="#three-models-in-three-months" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">Three models in three months</a></li><li><a href="#get-started" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary inline-block py-1 text-balance">Get started</a></li><!--]--></div> <!--[!--><!--]--></ul><!--]--> <div class="wrapper prose text-story prose-h1:text-heading prose-h2:text-heading prose-headings:font-normal prose-h3:text-subheading prose-h3:mb-4 prose-h3:mt-12 prose-h4:mb-4 prose-h4:mt-10 prose-h4:text-list prose-headings:scroll-mt-4 lg:prose-headings:scroll-mt-10 prose-p:text-story prose-headings:mt-section-gap-md prose-headings:mb-article-subsection-gap prose-ul:marker:text-mono-400 prose-ol:marker:text-tertiary prose-blockquote:mt-12 text-primary prose-strong:font-medium prose-pre:rounded-none prose-img:my-0 prose-thead:border-b-primary prose-thead:border-b-2 prose-li:text-story prose-tr:border-b-primary prose-th:font-medium prose-headings:text-primary prose-strong:text-primary prose-headings:[&amp;>strong]:text-secondary prose-a:text-pri-800 prose-a:font-normal prose-a:hover:text-pri-700 prose-pre:p-8 prose-li:[&amp;>p]:my-4 prose-a:underline-offset-4 prose-ul:text-list col-span-1 col-start-1 row-start-1 min-w-0 max-w-[unset]  svelte-18z5kmr"><!--[--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[--><!----><!--[!--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[--><!--[!-->Today we’re releasing Laguna S 2.1, a significant step forward in our development of models that pursue longer horizon work and make effective use of reasoning.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!----></p><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[--><!----><!--[!--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[--><!--[!-->Laguna S 2.1 is a 118B total parameter Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) model with 8B activated parameters per token and supports a context window of up to 1M tokens in thinking and no-thinking modes. It went from the start of training to launch in under nine weeks, and on long-horizon coding benchmarks it holds its own against models many times its size. For every benchmark score we publish today, we are releasing full trajectories for every trial in the final evaluation set at <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[--><!----><a href="http://trajectories.poolside.ai/" class=" text-pri-800 hover:text-pri-600  inline" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[!--><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--> <!--[--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[--><!--[!-->trajectories.poolside.ai<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!----><!----></a><!----><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[--><!--[!-->.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!----></p><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[!--><!--[--><!----><div class="not-prose mb-10 mt-12 w-full"><!--[!--><!--[--><div class="eval-block @container svelte-zod422 is-compact" aria-label="Laguna model evaluation charts"><!--[--><ul class="legend svelte-zod422" aria-label="Models in these charts"><!--[--><li class="item svelte-zod422"><span class="icon svelte-zod422" style="color: var(--color-laguna-s)" aria-hidden="true"><!----><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.91431 6.05389C4.08819 1.59324 9.48707 -0.265389 13.947 1.91035C18.4066 4.08619 20.2634 9.47995 18.0934 13.9392C18.0911 13.944 18.0892 13.9483 18.0866 13.9536C15.9089 18.4092 10.5147 20.2642 6.05688 18.0895C4.38705 17.2748 3.03023 15.9879 2.1326 14.368C1.25575 12.785 0.876293 10.9983 1.03538 9.20259C1.07594 8.75055 1.4745 8.41627 1.92687 8.45598C2.37862 8.49623 2.7134 8.8958 2.67348 9.34843C2.54345 10.8161 2.85364 12.2763 3.57076 13.5712C4.17038 14.6539 5.02254 15.5535 6.05978 16.2099L9.36205 9.43633C8.10158 9.0456 7.06885 9.22497 6.98024 9.24219L6.97927 9.24122C6.96396 9.2446 6.94715 9.249 6.93774 9.25088H6.93484C6.56066 9.31353 6.19922 9.11132 6.05012 8.77375L5.96899 8.63177C5.87263 8.47187 5.7306 8.2621 5.55656 8.05322C5.32339 7.77339 5.03821 7.50298 4.73269 7.35393C4.42817 7.20542 4.03402 7.15244 3.66928 7.14724C3.30594 7.14206 2.98381 7.18452 2.83091 7.21775C2.52313 7.28497 2.20256 7.16988 2.008 6.9222C1.81381 6.67487 1.77615 6.3